## Apache NOTICE

Apache-2.0 section 4(d) requires a redistribution to carry the NOTICE file of any
dependency that has one. cargo-about does not collect NOTICE files, so this one is
copied by hand from the arrow-rs crates (`arrow-*` and `parquet`, which all ship the
same file). Check it when dependencies change; this lists every NOTICE file in the graph:

    cargo metadata --format-version 1 | jq -r '.packages[].manifest_path' \
      | xargs -n1 dirname | xargs -I{} find {} -maxdepth 1 -iname 'notice*'

```
